          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze nyina na bene se baraza, bamutumaho ngo aze bahagaze hanze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu benshi bari bicaye bamugose, baramubwira bati “Nyoko na bene so bari hanze baragushaka.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
